{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a macabre medieval world full of deception, trust, and supernatural powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>\u201cGoodGod\u201d</strong>, you take on one of three unique roles \u2013 <strong>God, Satan, or Disciple</strong> \u2013 in a nerve-wracking game full of secrets, decisions, and divine interventions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GoodGod is best played with 7 to 12 players</strong>, but it supports rounds from <strong>5 up to theoretically 100 participants</strong>. The bigger the group, the more complex the game \u2013 and the deeper the deception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847190/extras/5f5e89a8c2812c31a810efddf3f62e21.avif?t=1759918164\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847190/extras_big/5f5e89a8c2812c31a810efddf3f62e21.avif?t=1759918164 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Roles:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disciple:</strong> Complete tasks, empower God, and try to unmask Satan. Gain bonuses like speed boosts, prayer abilities, and a one-time weapon at 100% task progress.</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God:</strong> Oversees the game from above, protects disciples with divine powers, and triggers Armageddon at full power. Can initiate votes and influence the game world.</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satan:</strong> Disguised as a disciple, sabotages the game, kills in secret, and uses powerful dark abilities like invisibility or blinding God.</p>[/]</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847190/extras/f88fa51dc698cee222df5663fba10ddf.poster.avif?t=1759918164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847190/extras/f88fa51dc698cee222df5663fba10ddf.webm?t=1759918164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847190/extras/f88fa51dc698cee222df5663fba10ddf.mp4?t=1759918164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's it about?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <i>first-person social deduction game</i>, strategy, action, and teamplay collide. While disciples strengthen God's power through minigames and prayer, Satan lurks among them \u2013 hidden and deadly. God, meanwhile, watches from a bird\u2019s-eye view and uses supernatural powers to protect his followers \u2013 or to avert disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 asymmetric roles</strong> with unique gameplay</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person view for disciples</strong>, <strong>strategic top-down view for God</strong></p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval setting:</strong> Dark forests, ruins, and altars in a moody fantasy world</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prayer and crystal system:</strong> Strengthens God and unlocks new abilities</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting tasks &amp; minigames</strong> for power progression and deception</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussions &amp; voting</strong> only at set times \u2013 no talking during the round!</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game chat</strong></p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voting marks:</strong> God and Satan may each mark one person \u2013 but who was it?</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable skins:</strong> 13 unique outfits through in-game achievements</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator mode:</strong> Fallen disciples still help by collecting crystals</p>[/]<br></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scalable for large groups:</strong> Supports 5 to 100 players per match</p>[/]</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who do you trust? Who deceives you? And who brings the Armageddon?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Too many Blades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/e74b855d0384b66d0889228c6b07cb23f6864a17.jpg"},{"name":"What a Sword","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/494af1054c32beb6a2db394e5f5e244406efff11.jpg"},{"name":"The end of all things","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/b9be800290a4fcb1198b465ea3876b3eb511f500.jpg"},{"name":"Off with the head","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/11d499c5c10b6f5ca7e49aa522119eb94b7f7801.jpg"},{"name":"Special Horse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/bc056f8acf124edc0b037d411c6b2f98486556b0.jpg"},{"name":"It`s a me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/014df1864ce3c8d7e3e1b68f627bf859c686081d.jpg"},{"name":"I`m a Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/068064fdc9f7dfd24656e4b88e7cbd683843d0b6.jpg"},{"name":"The One!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/820bfc78d52129e2d4f4111d844b5ee4e73dc377.jpg"},{"name":"Amen!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3847190/3098d7fff1177ab118d0cef5c3e98339aeba32f7.jpg"},{"name":"Amen!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image